Reservation_Agreements_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the agreement is open ended
│   └── it should return the period figure for the budget's period
├── when a fixed term pays less in total than the period figure
│   └── it should return the term's exact calendar pay rounded down
├── when a fixed term pays at least the period figure
│   └── it should return the period figure
└── when the figure does not fit in 128 bits
    └── it should revert with InvalidRate
